        meter = 0.0, patience = 0.0, B7_CHAT_Q, "yes, a woman told me they pay for frowns, and I asked her who pays", outcome = mapOf(
            "en" to "Her smile stays. Her eyes go to the ceiling, and she doesn't answer. You move with the queue toward the desk.",
